  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Ray diagram for the question.\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/2018_phy_a3.png\">\r\n\r\n$I$ is image of source $S$ by the plane mirror placed perpendicularly along $X$ -axis.\r\n$S M=I M$\r\n$\\therefore P M+M S=P M+M I=P I$\r\n$\\therefore \\quad P I=\\sqrt{(3-0)^{2}+(3+1)^{2}}$\r\n$=\\sqrt{9+16}=\\sqrt{25}=5$",
    "image": null
